  "Buff from Talent [Bloom]. After you use [Fragrance of Time], give the main target $1 turns of [Budding]: Gain $3 stack of [Blossom] when dealing $2 hit of skill damage: Increase ATK for $3 turns, up to $4 stacks. When reaching $5 stacks of [Blossom], additionally increase their ATK based on own Crit DMG; When reaching $6 stacks of [Blossom], additionally increase their Crit DMG based on own Crit DMG.": "",
