  "Increase all allies' ATK based on $2 of {{A}}'s Crit DMG that exceeds $1 (up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of Crit DMG). Lasts for $4 turns. Then restore $5 SP. While this effect is active, when any ally deal damage with a Persona skill/Follow Up/HIGHLIGHT/{{C}}, restore {{A}}'s SP by $6, this can only activate once.": "",
  "Spend all SP, increase <color=#FFFF00>1 other</color> ally's Crit Rate by $1. For every $2 SP spent, additionally trigger the following effects at $3 for $4 turns, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Crit DMG: \\nSpend $6 SP: Increase ATK by $9 for every $8 Crit DMG over $7;\\nSpend $10 SP: Increase Crit DMG for every $12 Crit DMG over $11;\\nSpend $13 SP: Additionally increase Crit DMG for every $15 Crit DMG over $14.": "",
