  "r:\"Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, and inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Windswept</u></link> and <link\\=(.+?)><u>Falling Petals</u></link> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nFalling Petals: When taking Wind damage, increase Attack for that damage\\. The increase is equal to (.+?)% of the portion of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds 100% \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of critical multiplier\\)\\.\\nAlso, restore Tempest Riko's SP by (\\d+)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's Attack for (\\d+) turns\\. The increase is equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of the portion of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds (\\d+)% \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of critical multiplier\\)\\. Also, restore party's SP by (\\d+)\\.\\nFor one time only while this effect is active, when an ally deals damage with a skill, Resonance, Highlight, or Theurgy, restore Tempest Riko's SP by (\\d+)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A warm spring breeze surrounds your allies, increasing the party's Attack\\.</color></size\\></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Spend all SP, and increase 1 other ally's critical rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, apply the following effects based on the amount of SP spent\\. For every (\\d+) SP spent, increase the effect by (\\d+)%\\.\\n(\\d+) SP or higher: For every (\\d+)% of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds 100%, increase Attack by (.+?)\\.\\n(\\d+) SP or higher: Increase critical damage by (\\d+)% of the portion of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds 100%\\.\\n(\\d+) SP or higher: Increase critical damage more by (\\d+)% of the portion of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds 100%\\.\\nThese effects count up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Increase 1 other ally's Attack \\(for every 1% of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds 100%, increase Attack by (.+?), up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of critical multiplier\\) and increase critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, restore (\\d+) SP to all allies besides Tempest Riko\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Wind damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"After using Blossoming Season, grant Unravel to the target for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nUnravel: Each time skill damage is dealt, gain (\\d+) Blossom stack\\.\\nBlossom: Increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\. After gaining (\\d+) Blossom stacks, increase Attack more by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of the portion of Tempest Riko's critical multiplier that exceeds 100%, and increase critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of the portion of her critical multiplier that exceeds 100%\\. After gaining (\\d+) Blossom stacks, critical damage is increased more\\. This increase is equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of the portion of her critical multiplier that exceeds 100%\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"During battle, increase critical damage and HP based on Tempest Riko's SP Recovery\\. At a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> SP Recovery, increase critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>, and HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color>\\.\"": "",
  "Increase Tempest Riko's max SP to 200, and increase her SP Recovery by 60%. When using a skill to restore her own SP, the amount recovered is affected by SP Recovery.\\nWhen using Blossoming Season, spend all SP, and activate different effects based on the amount of SP spent.": "",
  "The condition to activate the <link\\=\"s|218\"><u>Falling Petals</u></link> effect from Storm of Petals changes from Wind damage to any attribute damage. Also, increase the target's critical damage taken by 30%.\\nArrival of Spring increases Sweeper allies' Attack by 25% more.": "",
  "r:\"Increase Tempest Riko's max SP by (\\d+) \\(also increase the maximum effect of Blossoming Season\\)\\. Also, after activating Blossoming Season, immediately recover (\\d+) SP\\.\\nEnhance the effect of the Talent Vernal Splendor: Double the critical damage increase after gaining ([\\d\\/]+) <link\\=(.+)><u>Blossom</u></link> stacks\\.\"": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Arrival of Spring and Blossoming Season by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: The buff effect now applies to all allies besides Tempest Riko. Increase the main target's critical damage by 12% more, and restore 32 SP to all allies besides Tempest Riko.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Storm of Petals and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Blossoming Season now affects all allies besides Tempest Riko. When the main target uses a skill, immediately activate Storm of Petals 1 time on the target foe. This effect can only be activated 1 time for each use of Blossoming Season. Also, extend the duration of <link\\=\"s|218\"><u>Falling Petals</u></link> from Storm of Petals by 1 turn.\\nWhile Riko is on the field, when any ally deals damage, for every 1% of their critical rate that exceeds 100%, increase the critical damage of that damage by 2%.": "",
  "r:\"^Decrease\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes'\\\\s+Def\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\.\\\\s+If\\\\s+Riko's\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+is\\\\s+at\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+or\\\\s+more,\\\\s+decrease\\\\s+Def\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+per\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+points\\\\s+of\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+over\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%,\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Also\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+Insight\\\\s+on\\\\s+main\\\\s+foe\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase\\\\s+foe's\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+taken\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nIf\\\\s+ally\\\\s+deals\\\\s+weakness\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+with\\\\s+skill\\\\s+or\\\\s+knocks\\\\s+down\\\\s+foe,\\\\s+decrease\\\\s+cooldown\\\\s+time\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\.\\\\s+When\\\\s+cooldown\\\\s+time\\\\s+reaches\\\\s+(\\\\d+),\\\\s+activate\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Spend\\\\s+all\\\\s+Intel\\\\s+stacks\\\\s+to\\\\s+grant\\\\s+Fair\\\\s+Winds\\\\s+to\\\\s+party\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+turn\\\\s+and\\\\s+restore\\\\s+targeted\\\\s+ally's\\\\s+HP\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\.\\\\nFair\\\\s+Winds:\\\\s+Increase\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+foes\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\.\\\\s*Increase\\\\s+more\\\\s+based\\\\s+on\\\\s+Riko's\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+and\\\\s+number\\\\s+of\\\\s+Intel\\\\s+spent\\\\.\\\\s*If\\\\s+Riko's\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+is\\\\s+at\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+or\\\\s+more,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+Atk\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+per\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+points\\\\s+of\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+over\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%,\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+turn\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes'\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+taken\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nIf\\\\s+ally\\\\s+lowers\\\\s+foe's\\\\s+Down\\\\s+Points\\\\s+or\\\\s+knocks\\\\s+down\\\\s+foe,\\\\s+decrease\\\\s+cooldown\\\\s+time\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\.\\\\s+When\\\\s+cooldown\\\\s+time\\\\s+reaches\\\\s+(\\\\d+),\\\\s+activate\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Decrease\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes'\\\\s+Def\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\.\\\\s+When\\\\s+Riko's\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+is\\\\s+at\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+or\\\\s+more,\\\\s+decrease\\\\s+Def\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+per\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+points\\\\s+of\\\\s+Speed\\\\s+over\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%,\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Also\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+Insight\\\\s+on\\\\s+main\\\\s+foe\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"Wind dmg to 1 foe \\((.+?)% Atk\\), and inflict Windswept and Falling Petals \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nFalling Petals: When taking Wind dmg, increase Atk for that dmg\\. Increase is equal to (.+?)% of Tempest Riko's crit mult above 100% \\(max (.+?)% of crit mult\\)\\.\\nAlso, restore Tempest Riko's SP by (\\d+)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's Atk \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\. Increase is equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of Riko's crit mult above (\\d+)% \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)% of crit mult\\)\\. Also, restore (\\d+) SP\\.\\nWhile this effect is active, when an ally deals dmg with a skill, Resonance, Highlight, or Theurgy, restore Riko's SP by (\\d+) \\((\\d+) time only\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Spend all SP, and increase 1 other ally's crit rate ([\\d.]+)%\\s*\\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\s*Also apply following effects based on SP spent\\.\\s*Increase effects 1% per (\\d+) SP spent\\.\\s*50\\+\\s*SP:\\s*Increase Atk ([\\d.]+)\\s*per 1% of crit mult over 100%\\.\\s*100\\+\\s*SP:\\s*Increase crit dmg by (\\d+)%\\s*of crit mult over 100%\\.\\s*150\\s*SP\\s*or\\s*higher:\\s*Increase crit dmg more by (\\d+)%\\s*of crit mult over 100%\\.\\s*These effects count up to ([\\d.]+)%\\s*of Tempest Riko's crit mult\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase 1 other ally's Atk \\(([\\d.]+) per 1% of Riko's crit mult over 100%, max ([\\d.]+)% of crit mult\\), and increase crit dmg ([\\d.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nAlso, restore (\\d+) SP to all allies besides Riko\\.\"": ""
